(
  'Partnerships',
  'Partnership Intake',
  'I want to partner with SCEF',
  'Welcome! SCEF partners with corporates, NGOs, governments, donors, schools, media, and diaspora stakeholders across 10 partnership tracks.',
  E'Hello and welcome to Sophia Support for Santos Creations Educational Foundation (SCEF).\n\nThank you for your interest in partnering with SCEF. We welcome partnerships with individuals, schools, NGOs, CSR organizations, government agencies, development institutions, media partners, donors, sponsors, and diaspora stakeholders who want to support education, advocacy, youth empowerment, women and girls education, digital learning, and sustainable development across Africa.\n\nPlease choose the type of partnership you would like to discuss:\n\n1️⃣ CSR / Corporate Partnership\n2️⃣ EduAid-Africa Partnership\n3️⃣ NESA-Africa Sponsorship or Endorsement\n4️⃣ School Support / Adopt-a-School Partnership\n5️⃣ Training & Webinar Partnership\n6️⃣ Women & Girls Education Partnership\n7️⃣ Local Chapter Partnership\n8️⃣ Media / Advocacy Partnership\n9️⃣ Donation / Scholarship Partnership\n🔟 General Institutional Partnership\n\nTo help the SCEF Partnership Desk respond properly, please share:\n\n- Your name or organization name\n- Country and city\n- Type of partnership you are interested in\n- Program you want to support\n- Your email address\n- Your phone number or WhatsApp number\n- A short note on how you would like to partner with SCEF\n\nIf you already have a proposal, concept note, CSR brief, sponsorship request, or institutional profile, you may also share it for review.\n\nI can connect your request to the SCEF Partnership Desk for follow-up through the official WhatsApp support line:\nhttps://wa.me/2348109765897',
  ARRAY['partnership','partner','csr','corporate','sponsorship','collaboration','mou','ngo','adopt a school','institutional','diaspora','endorsement'],
  'SCEF', 'partners', 'partnership',
  'high', 'published', 'en', true, 'Partnership Desk'
),
(
  'Donations & Payments',
  'Donation Intake',
  'I want to donate or make a payment',
  'Welcome! Choose a program to support and a payment option (GFA Wallet, bank transfer, sponsorship invoice, or CSR payment).',
  E'Hello and welcome to Sophia Support for Santos Creations Educational Foundation (SCEF).\n\nThank you for your interest in supporting this program. I can help you with donation and payment options.\n\nPlease choose what you want to support:\n\n1️⃣ EduAid-Africa\n2️⃣ NESA-Africa\n3️⃣ Rebuild My School Africa\n4️⃣ Send a Child to School\n5️⃣ Women & Girls Education\n6️⃣ Training & Webinars\n7️⃣ Local Chapter Support\n8️⃣ General SCEF Donation\n\nAvailable payment support options may include:\n\n✅ GFA Wallet payment\n✅ Bank transfer\n✅ Corporate sponsorship invoice\n✅ CSR partnership payment\n✅ Event, training, or webinar payment\n✅ Donation receipt and acknowledgement letter\n\nTo proceed, please reply with:\n\n- The program you want to support\n- Donation amount\n- Preferred currency\n- Your name or organization name\n- Email address for receipt\n- Whether this is a donation, sponsorship, CSR support, or partnership payment\n\nFor your safety, please do not send your bank PIN, OTP, card password, wallet password, or private account codes here.\n\nIf your payment needs human confirmation, I can connect you to the SCEF Finance Desk through the official WhatsApp support line:\nhttps://wa.me/2348109765897',
  ARRAY['donate','donation','pay','payment','gfa wallet','bank transfer','sponsorship','csr','invoice','receipt','contribute','give'],
  'SCEF', 'donors', 'payments',
  'high', 'published', 'en', true, 'Finance Desk'
),
(
  'Donations & Payments',
  'Donation & Sponsorship Intake (Expanded)',
  'How can I donate, sponsor, or make a CSR payment to SCEF?',
  'SCEF accepts donations, sponsorships, CSR support, and program contributions via bank transfer, GFA Wallet, and corporate invoices.',
  E'Hello and welcome to Sophia Support for Santos Creations Educational Foundation (SCEF).\n\nThank you for your interest in supporting our work. I can help you with donations, sponsorship payments, CSR support, program contributions, and payment guidance.\n\nPlease choose what you would like to support:\n\n1️⃣ General SCEF Donation\n2️⃣ EduAid-Africa\n3️⃣ NESA-Africa\n4️⃣ Rebuild My School Africa\n5️⃣ Send a Child to School\n6️⃣ Women & Girls Education\n7️⃣ Training & Webinars\n8️⃣ Local Chapter Support\n9️⃣ Scholarship Support\n🔟 CSR / Corporate Sponsorship\n\nAvailable payment support options may include:\n\n✅ Bank transfer\n✅ GFA Wallet payment\n✅ Corporate invoice\n✅ Sponsorship payment\n✅ Donation receipt\n✅ Acknowledgement letter\n✅ CSR partnership documentation\n\nTo proceed, please send the following details:\n\n- Program you want to support\n- Donation or payment amount\n- Preferred currency\n- Your name or organization name\n- Email address for receipt\n- Payment type: donation, sponsorship, CSR support, partnership payment, or program fee\n\nFor your safety, please do not send your bank PIN, OTP, card password, wallet password, or private account codes in this chat.\n\nIf your payment needs confirmation or official documentation, I can connect you to the SCEF Finance Desk through our official WhatsApp support line:\nhttps://wa.me/2348109765897',
  ARRAY['donate','donation','sponsor','sponsorship','csr','corporate','scholarship','invoice','receipt','acknowledgement','program fee','give','contribute','payment'],
  'SCEF', 'donors', 'payments',
  'high', 'published', 'en', true, 'Finance Desk'
);